Comment:
 Installed only into the CPack DEB (packaging/cpack/license-files.cmake).
 .
 The CC0-1.0 paragraph refers to /usr/share/common-licenses/CC0-1.0 instead
 of carrying the text. That relies on base-files shipping the file, as
 base-files 14.x in Debian testing does (checked with 14.2). If this DEB is
 ever built for an older Debian or Ubuntu release whose base-files lacks it,
 embed the full CC0-1.0 text in that paragraph.
 .
 Files patterns are relative to the source tree. The installed
 /usr/share/metainfo/org.fcitx.Fcitx5.Addon.Oxpinyin.metainfo.xml is
 generated from the template org.fcitx.Fcitx5.Addon.Oxpinyin.metainfo.xml.in.
 .
 Stanza order matters: the last matching Files stanza wins, so the metainfo
 stanza must stay after "Files: *".

